摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Run Claude Design locally as an Agent Skill — Cursor, Codex, DeepSeek Harness & more. Produce polished UI mockups, prototypes, decks & wireframes as self-contained HTML, without claude.ai/design. Best with Opus or Claude.","id":"gh:1261650101","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"baoyu-design","slug":"JimLiu/baoyu-design","topics":["agent-skills","claude","claude-code","claude-design","cursor","design","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","prototyping","ui-design"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Run Claude Design locally as an Agent Skill — Cursor, Codex, DeepSeek Harness & more. Produce polish"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ed UI mockups, prototypes, decks & wireframes as self-contained HTML, without claude.ai/design. Best"},{"id":"p1s3","text":" with Opus or Claude."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# baoyu-design"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d5b4f39b-a701-49de-87b8-64f3c6ef9c61"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/84ddf462-5ac6-44c6-a175-05a7ccaa019e"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/db6c5d93-dc28-4170-8356-4dbe5725a57c"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"**Run Claude Design on your own local agent — Cursor, Claude Code, Claude Desktop, or any file‑capab"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"n on your own local agent — Cursor, Claude Code, Claude Desktop, or any file‑capable coding agent.**"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"English · 简体中文 · Changelog"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"This repo brings claude.ai's **Artifact types** to local agents: editable slide decks, design canvas"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"es, design systems, data dashboards and motion films, each opened in its own editor that runs on you"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"r machine. `motion-director` directs those films, from the point of the film to the finished cut. `d"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"ataviz` is the chart guide the agent reads before it draws any chart, in these skills or anywhere el"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"se. The five editors also ship as DeepSeek Harness plugins, installed from npm by name."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"The original `baoyu-design` skill (self‑contained HTML mockups and prototypes) has been archived to "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"`archive/baoyu-design/`."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"No website, no separate subscription, no upload step. The agent already on your machine does the wor"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"k, and every artifact stays in your repo."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Skills in this repo"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Skill | Makes | You edit it in |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| `claude-slides` | Slide decks: `project/deck.json` plus one HTML file per slide | The slides edito"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"r: present, retype, drag; export PDF, HTML or PowerPoint |\n| `claude-design` | A canvas of artboards"},{"id":"p13s3","text":": `project/canvas.json` plus `.dc.html` Design Components | The canvas editor: artboards side by sid"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"e, play prototypes, retype copy, adjust tweaks; export HTML, PDF or PNG |\n| `claude-design-system` |"},{"id":"p13s5","text":" Design systems: tokens, a README brand book, component previews, fonts, asset groups | The design s"},{"id":"p13s6","text":"ystem editor: browse and edit colors, type, components and assets |\n| `claude-dashboard` | Data‑back"},{"id":"p13s7","text":"ed dashboards: datasets (CSV, TSV, JSON) and a page of charts, numbers and tables over them | The da"},{"id":"p13s8","text":"shboard page: live charts, filters, and a Sources panel that traces every number to its rows |\n| `cl"},{"id":"p13s9","text":"aude-motion` | Motion films: animated videos, 10–30 s unless you ask for more and 15 minutes at most"},{"id":"p13s10","text":", written as code scene by scene into the film's own store under `<root>/db/` | The Motion player: w"},{"id":"p13s11","text":"atch it fill in, retype lines, drag scene lengths, adjust style and tweaks; export MP4 or GIF |\n| `m"},{"id":"p13s12","text":"otion-director` | A finished film with something to say: it finds the point, writes the narration fo"},{"id":"p13s13","text":"r the ear, has it voiced, times every scene to the words, and checks the frames as a viewer would. N"},{"id":"p13s14","text":"eeds `claude-motion` beside it | The same Motion player, open from the first minute |\n| `dataviz` | "},{"id":"p13s15","text":"Better charts in any medium (HTML, SVG, d3, matplotlib, plotly…): picking the form, colors that stay"},{"id":"p13s16","text":" readable in light and dark and for color‑blind readers, marks, legends and tooltips, with a palette"},{"id":"p13s17","text":" validator script | Nothing to open: the agent reads it before writing chart code; swap `palette.md`"},{"id":"p13s18","text":" for your brand's colors |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Artifact skills: editable decks, canvases, design systems, dashboards and films"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"These five skills write the Artifact type's own file format into a folder and open it in that type's"},{"id":"p15s2","text":" editor page, served from your machine. The agent writes the files and the editor shows each write a"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"t once; your edits in the editor are saved back into the same files, so you and the agent can take t"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"e; your edits in the editor are saved back into the same files, so you and the agent can take turns."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"In the slides, canvas and design-system editors and on the dashboard page, choose **Comment** (or pr"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ess **C**) to comment on an element or area; in the Motion player, its **Comment** button comments o"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"n a moment of the film. Comments stay in the project's local `comments.json`; the agent reads and re"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"plies through `artifact.mjs`. While it listens with `comments <root> --wait`, the editor offers **Se"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"nd to Agent** to send your comment for it to act on."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### `claude-slides`: slide decks"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"A deck is `project/deck.json` plus one HTML file per slide. In the editor you can present full scree"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"n, retype any text, drag elements, add text, images, tables and shapes, and export to PDF, HTML or P"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"owerPoint. *Above: a five‑slide health class deck about sleep, built on a sample design system.*"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### `claude-design`: a canvas of artboards"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### `claude-design-system`: design systems"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### `claude-dashboard`: data‑backed dashboards"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### `claude-motion`: motion films"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### Run the editors"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Why run it locally"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- **Free yourself from the website.** You get the vast majority of `claude.ai/design`'s capabilities"},{"id":"p31s2","text":" without ever leaving your editor — same methodology, same craft standards, same output format.\n- **"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"Best with Opus 5.5.** The skill is a long, demanding design brief; the stronger the model, the bette"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"r the result. Pair it with **Claude Opus 5.5** for the best output, and it still works well on other"},{"id":"p31s5","text":" capable models.\n- **Edit side by side with the agent.** Each editor runs on `localhost`; your edits"},{"id":"p31s6","text":" save back into the same files the agent writes, so you can take turns.\n- **Work together, no cloud."},{"id":"p31s7","text":"** Share an editor on your local network with a link per role; others edit, comment or watch, and yo"},{"id":"p31s8","text":"u decide who stays in. Version history shows who changed what and brings any version back.\n- **Every"},{"id":"p31s9","text":"thing is yours.** Output lands in `designs/<slug>/` as plain files you can version, fork, export, or"},{"id":"p31s10","text":"is yours.** Output lands in `designs/<slug>/` as plain files you can version, fork, export, or ship."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"### Prerequisites"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"- A local agent — **Cursor**, **Claude Code**, **Codex**, or any of the 70+ agents the installer sup"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"ports (Cline, Roo Code, GitHub Copilot…). Cursor, Claude Code, and Codex have first‑class tool refer"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"ences inside the skill.\n- **Claude Opus 5.5** selected as the model, for best results.\n- **Node.js**"},{"id":"p33s4","text":", for the `npx` installer below and for the artifact skills' editors (Node 20+, the dashboard and Mo"},{"id":"p33s5","text":" installer below and for the artifact skills' editors (Node 20+, the dashboard and Motion Node 22+)."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
